# ASNs that should be proxied, one per line. The workflow expands each of them
# into all of its announced prefixes via RouteViews.
# Prefix counts as of 2026-09-20 (queried from RouteViews): Meta 255+362,
# X 26+4, Wikimedia 11+11, Valve 45+35, Zoom 314+84.

32934    # Meta / Facebook / Instagram / WhatsApp
13414    # X / Twitter
14907    # Wikimedia / Wikipedia
32590    # Valve / Steam
30103    # Zoom

# Enable these on demand (large prefix counts, or shared with unrelated sites)
# 2906   # Netflix (prefer domain rules: the IP ranges pull its whole CDN in)
# 54113  # Fastly (shared by Reddit, Shopify and many other sites)
# 714    # Apple, full AS714 (~1500 prefixes; the local 17.0.0.0/8 is usually enough)
